        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Chinchila. Quando sua cauda fica suja ao limpar a si mesmo ou o ninho, Minccino passa um dia inteiro lavando-a em água pura de nascente. Esses Pokémon adoram limpeza e usam as caudas como vassouras para varrer e tirar o pó de seu habitat.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 25% M / 75% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Minccino pode evoluir para Cinccino no nível 8 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Shiny Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Helping Hand, Tickle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Double Slap, Encore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Sing, Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Charm, Tail Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Echoed Voice, Wake-Up Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Captivate, Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>After You, Hyper Voice, Last Resort</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Alluring Voice, Aqua Tail, Attract, Baton Pass, Bullet Seed, Calm Mind, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Dig, Double Team, Echoed Voice, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fling, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Last Resort, Mud-Slap, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Swift, Tail Slap, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Triple Axel, U-turn, Uproar, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Endure, Fake Tears, Flail, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Mud-Slap, Sleep Talk, Tail Whip, Tidy Up</p>",
